 "text": "Good afternoon Douglas. Wednesday 14 October, 17:28 UK.\n\n### Updated groups from games still to start\n**Oscar (Odds Analyst):** 5 of the 5 legs below have a live bookmaker price (11 of today's 19 picks priced in all); prices from the Sports Almanac's Odds tab: API-Football for football, ESPN for NFL and baseball, tennis and rugby on the model's fair price.\n\n**Jade (Accumulator Strategist):** Five tested picks per group, each with a short, a middle and (Balanced and Stretch) a longer price, no leg used twice. Chances are the tested hit rates at each pick's level. Steady lands most often; Stretch pays more. All groups are also on the [Odds tab](https://douglasbakeronline.github.io/footyalmanac/).\n\n**Balanced** · combined odds 4.58 · all five land on tested rates 18% · bookmakers imply 22%\n\n| UK | Selection | Event | Odds | Tested chance | Research |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 18:00 | Haugesund | Haugesund v Lyn (1. Division) | 1.23 | 74% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Haugesund+vs+Lyn+prediction+14+October+2026) |\n| 18:00 | Bryne | Bryne v Raufoss (1. Division) | 1.24 | 68% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Bryne+vs+Raufoss+prediction+14+October+2026) |\n| 20:00 | Aston Villa | Aston Villa v Fenerbahce (Champions League) | 1.70 | 76% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Aston+Villa+vs+Fenerbahce+prediction+14+October+2026) |\n| 22:30 | Atlético Junior | Atlético Junior v Deportivo Pereira (Primera A) | 1.30 | 68% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Atl%C3%A9tico+Junior+vs+Deportivo+Pereira+prediction+14+October+2026) |\n| 00:30 | Independiente Santa Fe | Independiente Santa Fe v Jaguares de Córdoba (Primera A) | 1.36 | 68% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Independiente+Santa+Fe+vs+Jaguares+de+C%C3%B3rdoba+prediction+15+October+2026) |\n\nModel probabilities are footyalmanac's own; our backtest says bookmakers still price football slightly better than the model, so treat these as informed suggestions, not value bets. Accumulators multiply the bookmaker margin. Not betting advice."
